    "surfaceMetric": "For ANKLE_MEDIAL_MALLEOLUS_TO_SOLE, measure shortest-path distance on Skin mesh FJ2810 triangle edges after endpoint-to-skin snapping.",
    "fingerCun": "If a point sentence gives only a numeric F-cun without naming a finger-width technique, use the canonical 1 F-cun middle-finger method; explicit source technique would override this."
